{"id":"c6ba04763086ca5d","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-filter2-product-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter2 Product Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter2-product-filter — ZFC Filter2 Product Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter2-product-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter2-product-filter","58-df-zfc-filter6-product-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter2-product-filter — ZFC Filter2 Product Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-filter]]","[[58-df-product]]","[[58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter2-product-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-product-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-product-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter2-product-filter — ZFC Filter2 Product Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3579e07be41aa5cd\" href=\"?note=3579e07be41aa5cd\" title=\"58-df-product\">58-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d1121e6ff027ff98\" href=\"?note=d1121e6ff027ff98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md\">58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y \\in V\">\\(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProductFilter}_S \\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProductFilter}_S \\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProductFilter}_S \\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProductFilter}_S \\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}product\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProductFilter}_S(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal G,Y)\\land\\mathcal H=\\{H\\subseteq X\\times Y:\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal G\\;(A\\times B\\subseteq H)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}product\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProductFilter}_S(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal G,Y)\\land\\mathcal H=\\{H\\subseteq X\\times Y:\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal G\\;(A\\times B\\subseteq H)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}product\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProductFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProductFilter}_S(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}product\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProductFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProductFilter}_S(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The product filter is generated by rectangles from two proper factor filters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"3579e07be41aa5cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProductFilter}_S \\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProductFilter}_S \\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}product\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProductFilter}_S(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal G,Y)\\land\\mathcal H=\\{H\\subseteq X\\times Y:\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal G\\;(A\\times B\\subseteq H)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}product\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6ProductFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ProductFilter}_S(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,X,Y)","display":true}],"bytes":1383,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1900","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter2-product-filter.md|58-df-zfc-filter2-product-filter]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1331244a5201bb99","3579e07be41aa5cd","d1121e6ff027ff98"]}